{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>For their mother has played the harlot</b> [Hosea 2:7] — the meaning of מאהבי: a verb going out to two objects, for they sought that I would be a lover of theirs on account of their gifts, and that I would say: כי מימי הוא התירוש — and he brought proof from ותירושי במועדו. This is not correct, for התירוש and תירושי stand opposite שיקויי." "And the meaning of מימי is like ואכלכלם לחם ומים, and the prophet said: לחם לא אכלתי ומים לא שתיתי, and מים בכסף תתן לי."], :book :hosea, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {0 "The comment addresses a dispute over the syntax and meaning of מאהבי and the phrase כי מימי הוא התירוש; the referent of 'he brought proof' is an unnamed opponent, resolved by context."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Hosea -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=15&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:49:53.558414187Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}